## How to work in this repo

1. **Read first.** `.claude/CLAUDE.md` (lifecycle contract) and `.claude/patterns/BASELINE.md` (non-negotiables) are mandatory pre-reads at the start of every task.
2. **Spec-Driven.** Spec policy is **`{{SPEC_POLICY}}`**. For non-trivial tasks under `required` or `recommended`, write `.claude/specs/<slug>/spec.md` BEFORE touching code (via `/spec`, `/triage`, or `/architect`).
3. **Self-audit loop.** Implementing specialists run the BABYSIT loop (L0 spec citation → L1 mechanical auditor → L1.5 spec-drift → L2 semantic reviewer → L3 rubber-duck for M/L tasks) before handing off.
4. **Telemetry.** Critical/High findings logged to `.claude/learning/violations.md`. Recurring violations get promoted via `/evolve-claude`.

