## Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `/triage <task>` | Lightweight 3-perspective pre-dev brief |
| `/spec <slug>: <task>` | 1-page spec on disk for S/M tasks |
| `/architect <feature>` | Full spec with field research for L tasks |
| `/brainstorm <idea>` | Divergent design exploration |
| `/start-task` | Open worktree + branch for the task |
| `/check` | Type + lint + format + test loop |
| `/finish-task` | Coverage → review → check → PR |
| `/code-review` | Independent semantic review |
| `/normalize <target>` | Read-only audit against patterns |
| `/duck-debug` | Rubber-duck dialogue for M/L work |
| `/evolve-claude` | Refine `.claude/` from telemetry + drift |

## Pre-flight checklist for agents

Before writing any code, confirm out loud:

- [ ] **Baseline activated:** R-IDs from `BASELINE.md` that apply.
- [ ] **Spec activated:** path to `.claude/specs/<slug>/spec.md` (or `brief.md`, or explicit waiver).
- [ ] **Knowledge activated:** entries from `.claude/knowledge/<specialist>.md`.
- [ ] **Violations radar:** recent codes from `.claude/learning/violations.md`.

If any of these is missing and the task is non-trivial, STOP and resolve it before editing.

